"Speech","speaker":"behavenikke","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_04_s_31","text":"So you cut off your squadmates' heads off and brought them in?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_04_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"behavenikke","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_04_s_32","text":"And you've still got an appetite after all that grisly business?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_04_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_04_s_33","text":"I fail to see the correlation between the two.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_04_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"behavenikke","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_04_s_34","text":"Oh, well... it's just... there you are yukking it up with your squadmates one moment, and the next, you're cutting off their heads.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_04_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"behavenikke","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_04_s_35","text":"Yet you seem completely unaffected.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_04_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_04_s_36","text":"I simply felt the best outcome would be for them to be brought back to life.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"af